<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh taka eases against dollar.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh taka eases against dollar.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1996-09-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The taka eased to 42.3750/42.3950 to the dollar in interbank trading compared with the previous 42.3500/42.3800, dealers said.</p>
<p>They said the taka weakened as some foreign banks bought dollars for import payments.</p>
<p>The interbank call money rates closed unchanged at 4.0-4.5 percent.</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom 880-2-506363</p>
</text>
